{
  "_readme": [
    "Photography manifest. Every entry maps a local filename to an Unsplash",
    "photo id, the crop to request, and the alt text describing what the",
    "photo actually shows.",
    "",
    "Each id below was reviewed visually before being assigned \u2014 alt text is",
    "written from the real image, not guessed from the slot name.",
    "",
    "Run `npm run photos` to (re-)download. Images are served from",
    "/public/images, so the site has no runtime dependency on Unsplash.",
    "Photos are used under the Unsplash License."
  ],
